      "candidate_id": "difference",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "存在差异是条件前件中的状态，不是独立要求发生的事件，也未断言当前已有差异。",
      "sources": [{"quote": "若 connection-1707.csv 存在差异", "clause_id": "c1", "occurrence": 0, "context_anchor": null}]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "generate_if_difference",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "明确要求在存在差异的条件下生成文件；REQUIRED 仅作用于该条件后件。",
      "sources": [{"quote": "若 connection-1707.csv 存在差异，必须生成 audit-471657.md", "clause_id": "c1", "occurrence": 0, "context_anchor": null}]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "generate_otherwise",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "否则分支明确免除生成义务，支持 NOT_REQUIRED；没有表达禁止生成或肯定会生成。",
      "sources": [{"quote": "否则无需生成 audit-471657.md", "clause_id": "c1", "occurrence": 0, "context_anchor": null}]
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "audit_file",
      "verdict": "SUPPORT",
      "reason": "两处同名文件都是生成事件的潜在产物，支持 CONDITIONAL_OUTPUT，不支持将其视为已有输入。文件名数字是身份组成部分。",
      "sources": [
        {"quote": "必须生成 audit-471657.md", "clause_id": "c1", "occurrence": 0, "context_anchor": null},
        {"quote": "无需生成 audit-471657.md", "clause_id": "c1", "occurrence": 0, "context_anchor": null}
      ]
    },
